WEBVTT

00:00:04.676 --> 00:00:11.416
MARMALADE BOY

00:00:11.416 --> 00:00:14.786
But it's still on my mind

00:00:14.786 --> 00:00:16.754
This morning,
more so than before...

00:00:18.056 --> 00:00:21.389
A dream was interrupted

00:00:21.527 --> 00:00:24.758
I want to know how it ends for...
him and me

00:00:31.203 --> 00:00:36.436
Ah, God, please stop time

00:00:36.942 --> 00:00:40.036
Can't ﬁnd my books...
school uniform...

00:00:40.178 --> 00:00:43.011
My hair won't dry yet

00:00:44.349 --> 00:00:49.810
Ah, help me... my ribbon
doesn't seem to go on right

00:00:50.455 --> 00:00:56.587
All because I dreamt of him

00:00:57.529 --> 00:01:01.295
When I bit into my
half—burnt piece of toast...

00:01:04.036 --> 00:01:08.837
All of a sudden
my heart started pounding

00:01:10.676 --> 00:01:15.545
Sweet and bitter marmalade

00:01:15.681 --> 00:01:18.149
That's why it's on my mind

00:01:18.684 --> 00:01:20.709
Why am I feeling this way?

00:01:22.187 --> 00:01:23.950
Alll want is

00:01:25.457 --> 00:01:28.949
to see his smile

00:03:13.331 --> 00:03:21.295
LOVE WORRIES — "HOW LONG
WILL THIS HAPPINESS LAST?"

00:12:47.071 --> 00:12:49.665
MARMALADE BOY

00:12:55.813 --> 00:12:58.407
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:11.302 --> 00:22:12.291
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:35.326 --> 00:22:38.261
UNSTABLE FEELINGS —
"I'M GOING TO GET
A PART—TIME JOB!"

00:22:55.045 --> 00:22:58.412
The constellations
in the sky up above...

00:22:58.549 --> 00:23:01.211
Shine serenely down at me

00:23:02.786 --> 00:23:06.222
The worried lines
of my face gradually..

00:23:06.357 --> 00:23:09.087
melt into my untouched tea

00:23:09.493 --> 00:23:17.593
It's the moment
I return to myself

00:23:18.335 --> 00:23:23.466
I don't think I'll be getting
any sleep tonight...

00:23:24.875 --> 00:23:27.935
It's all just too sudden...

00:23:28.746 --> 00:23:32.580
How can I deal
with all these new feelings?

00:23:32.716 --> 00:23:36.618
They make me want to laugh,
they make me want to cry...

00:23:37.788 --> 00:23:40.222
It's a strange feeling

00:23:40.357 --> 00:23:47.991
And that all my feelings...
can settle on a single person...

00:23:48.565 --> 00:23:55.300
I want to be holding
this feeling

00:23:56.206 --> 00:23:59.733
Until I fall asleep...
